WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.603
A scalar subquery can also appear in the SELECT list
Here the

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:11.209
inner query calculates one overall average age
Because it is not

00:00:11.235 --> 00:00:16.922
correlated the same value appears beside every
patient row This

00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:22.472
is useful when you want to show a row value and a
benchmark together Run

00:00:22.498 --> 00:00:26.433
the query and notice that the average does not
change from patient to patient
